#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_keypoint_detection.rst:10
msgid "模型简介"
msgstr "Model introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_keypoint_detection.rst:12
msgid ""
"关键点检测模型用于识别物体上的特定关键点位置，输出每个关键点的坐标和可见性信息。最常见的应用是人体姿态估计，但也可用于任何需要定位关键特征点的场景。"
msgstr ""
"The keypoint detection model is used to identify specific keypoint locations"
" on an object and output the coordinates and visibility information of each "
"keypoint.The most common application is human pose estimation, but it can "
"also be used in any scenario where key feature points need to be located."

