#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_keypoint_detection.rst:226
msgid "**Q: 关键点坐标是归一化的还是绝对坐标？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: Are the key point coordinates normalized or absolute coordinates?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_keypoint_detection.rst:228
msgid "A: 关键点坐标为绝对像素坐标，与输入图像尺寸对应。"
msgstr ""
"A: The key point coordinates are absolute pixel coordinates, corresponding "
"to the input image size."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_keypoint_detection.rst:230
msgid "**Q: 如何判断某个关键点是否被遮挡？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to determine whether a key point is occluded?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_keypoint_detection.rst:232
msgid ""
"A: 检查该关键点的 ``visible`` 标志和 ``confidence`` 值。如果 ``visible`` 为 false 或 "
"``confidence`` 很低（如<0.3），说明该点可能被遮挡。"
msgstr ""
"A: Check the keypoint's ``visible`` flag and ``confidence`` value.If "
"``visible`` is false or ``confidence`` is very low (such as <0.3), the point"
" may be obscured."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_keypoint_detection.rst:234
msgid "**Q: 检测不到关键点怎么办？**"
msgstr "**Q: What should I do if the key points cannot be detected?**"

